Media assets

Source code in this repository is licensed under the MIT License above.

icon.png is the output of an AI image generation tool, not original hand-drawn
artwork. The author makes no copyright claim over it. Replacement instructions
are in README.md ("License" section).

The four menu icons under assets/pixel/ (cup, penguin, cat-ear headset, radio)
are original 16x16 pixel art generated by scripts/pixel-art.py.

The package ships no third-party images: wallpapers are imported by the user at
runtime and never enter the package.